als align collective motion\"}\n\n  :exotype-params\n  {:rotation 1\n   :match-threshold 0.6\n   :invert-on-phenotype? false\n   :update-prob 0.4\n   :mix-mode :majority\n   :description \"Collective alignment\"}\n\n  :tensor-interpretation\n  {:operation :consensus\n   :description \"Alignment through shared signal\"}\n\n  :regime-prediction\n  {:expected :cohesive\n   :dynamics \"Aligned patterns with steady exchange\"\n   :eoc-relevance \"Stabilizes without full collapse\"}\n\n@domain-transfer-notes\n  \"同人 is the pattern of FELLOWSHIP across domains:\n   - In ants: shared routes and coordinated return\n   - In CA: aligned motifs with exchange\""}], :conclusion "Fellowship arises from shared clarity and purpose; alignment enables coordinated action.", :directives {:audience "improvisers, system designers, CT practitioners", :sigils ["❄️/门"], :style "pattern", :title "䷌ 同人 (Tóng Rén) - Fellowship with Men", :tone "foundational"}, :id "iching/hexagram-13-tongren", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["❄️/门"], :source-path "library/iching/hexagram-13-tongren.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "䷌ 同人 (Tóng Rén) - Fellowship with Men", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "Great possession requires humility and wise distribution; abundance can destabilize if mishandled."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "A system has accumulated strong resources or advantage."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    Capacity is high and expansion is possible."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Hoarding or overconfidence leads to collapse."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Distribute resources and maintain order; keep the advantage aligned with purpose."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    Abundance is only stable when managed