ole clarity."} {:name "evidence", :name-key "evidence", :slug "evidence", :text "Traditional: \"The Marrying Maiden. Undertakings bring misfortune.\""} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - Identify role imbalance.\n    - Adjust expectations.\n    - Pair with ䷴ (漸) to restore gradual order.\n\n@ct-interpretation\n  :vision\n  {:objects #{:misaligned :adjusted}\n   :morphism {:id :realign\n              :source :misaligned\n              :target :adjusted\n              :type :role-correction}}\n\n  :as-morphism\n  {:domain :unequal\n   :codomain :balanced\n   :preservation :moderate\n   :composition :reorders}\n\n  :adapt\n  {:trigger :stabilized\n   :evidence [:roles-aligned]\n   :target :hexagram-53-jian}\n\n@ant-interpretation\n  :policy\n  {:mode-bias :adaptive\n   :policy-priors {:forage 0.3 :return 0.3 :hold 0.2 :pheromone 0.2}\n   :description \"Adjust roles and timing\"}\n\n  :precision\n  {:Pi-o 0.6\n   :tau 0.6\n   :description \"Responsive realignment\"}\n\n  :pattern-sense\n  {:trail-follow 0.5\n   :gradient-use 0.4\n   :novelty-seek 0.3\n   :description \"Adaptive correction\"}\n\n  :adapt-trigger\n  {:condition :roles-aligned\n   :interpretation \"Return to gradual progress\"\n   :switch-to :hexagram-53-jian}\n\n  :failure-mode\n  \"Persistent misalignment causes instability\"\n\n@mmca-interpretation\n  :sigil-encoding\n  {:sigil \"歸妹\"\n   :bits \"11010000\"\n   :interpretation \"Misaligned coupling\"}\n\n  :exotype-params\n  {:rotation 2\n   :match-threshold 0.5\n   :invert-on-phenotype? true\n   :update-prob 0.55\n   :mix-mode :xor-neighbor\n   :description \"Correct misalignment\"}\n\n  :tensor-interpretation\n  {:operation :realign\n   :description \"Correct improper alignment\"}\n\n  :regime-prediction\n  {:expected :corrective\n   :dynamics \"Adjustment of misalignment\"\n   :eoc-relevance \"Can destabilize then recover\"}\n\n@domain-transfer-notes\n  \"歸妹 is the pattern of MISALIGNED UNION across domains:\n   - In ants: role imbalance\n   - In CA: corrective adjustments\""}], :conclusion "An alliance formed out of sequence brings tension; align roles carefully.", :directives {:audience "improvisers, system designers, CT practitioners", :sigils ["👈/山"], :style "pattern", :title "䷵ 歸妹 (Guī Mèi) - The Marrying Maiden", :tone "foundational"}, :id "iching/hexagram-54-guimei", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["👈/山"], :source-path "library/iching/hexagram-54-guimei.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "䷵ 歸妹 (Guī Mèi) - The Marrying Maiden", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "Abundance shines brightly but declines quickly; manage peak with awareness."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "A system experiences peak activity or success."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    Resources and energy are at a maximum."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Peaks are transient and can lead to decline."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Use the peak wisely, prepare for reduction."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    Abundance must be stewarded to avoid collapse."} {:name "evidence", :name-key "evidence", :slug "evidence", :text "Traditional: \"Abundance. The king attains abundance.\""} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - Capitalize on the peak.\n    - Prepare for decline.\n    - Pair with ䷷ (旅) to handle transition.\n\n@ct-interpretation\n  :vision\n  {:objects #{:peak :managed}\n   :morphism {:id :steward-peak\n              :source :peak\n              :target :managed\n              :type :stewardship}}\n\n  :as-morphism\n  {:domain :abundant\n   :codomain :managed-abundance\n   :preservation :moderate\n   :composition :stabilizes-peak}\n\n  :adapt\n  {:trigger :decline\n   :evide