uasion\""}], :conclusion "Gentle, repeated influence penetrates more deeply than force.", :directives {:audience "improvisers, system designers, CT practitioners", :sigils ["🌆/风"], :style "pattern", :title "䷸ 巽 (Xùn) - The Gentle (Wind)", :tone "foundational"}, :id "iching/hexagram-57-xun", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["🌆/风"], :source-path "library/iching/hexagram-57-xun.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "䷸ 巽 (Xùn) - The Gentle (Wind)", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "Joy and openness increase flow, but they require discipline to remain constructive."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "A system thrives through exchange, delight, and mutual responsiveness."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    Signals are positive, cooperation is possible, and shared uplift improves performance."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Pleasure without boundary dissipates into distraction or indulgence."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Use joy as a coordination signal. Keep the channel open but bounded."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    Joy is a stabilizing feedback when it remains coupled to purpose."} {:name "evidence", :name-key "evidence", :slug "evidence", :text "Traditional: \"The Joyous. Success. Perseverance is favorable.\""} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - Identify where shared uplift improves coordination.\n    - Set limits to prevent drift.\n    - Pair with ䷜ (坎) to balance joy with caution.\n\n@ct-interpretation\n  :vision\n  {:objects #{:exchange :cohesion}\n   :morphism {:id :harmonize\n              :source :exchange\n              :target :cohesion\n              :type :cooperative}}\n\n  :as-morphism\n  {:domain :connected-state\n   :codomain :rei