rper pattern, or introduce a new check canon; document the decision and rerun the embedding cycle"} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    sigils are coordinates in the fake embedding—when they collapse, it signals our pattern library is too coarse for dhammavicaya to stay honest"} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    next[Log the next collision and document the merge or split decision.]"}], :conclusion "  treat duplicated sigils as alarms: inspect the overlapping clauses, decide whether to merge them, split out a sharper pattern, or introduce a new check canon; document the decision and rerun the embedding cycle", :directives {:factor "Keen investigation (dhammavicaya)", :sigils ["👂/习"], :title "Pattern Differentiation Alarms"}, :id "library-coherence/pattern-differentiation-alarms", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["👂/习"], :source-path "library/library-coherence/pattern-differentiation-alarms.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "Pattern Differentiation Alarms", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "  Show ∫_A f = 0 when f = 0 a.e. on A via integral_eq_zero_of_ae + filter_upwards."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "Goal is an integral vanishing over a set where the integrand is a.e. zero."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "Need to bridge between set membership and ae filtering."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "Use integral_eq_zero_of_ae with ae_restrict_mem and filter_upwards for the witness."} {:name "LEAN", :name-key "lean", :slug "lean", :text "      api[integral_eq_zero_of_ae] api[ae_restrict_mem] api[filter_upwards]\n      tactic[exact integral_eq_zero_of_ae → filter_upwards [...] with x hx]"} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "The ae_restrict_mem bridge converts \"f = 