rocal/division identities with field_simp + ne_of_gt for nonzero denominators.", :directives {:audience "lean-provers, analysis-students", :keywords ["field-simp" "reciprocal" "division" "ne_of_gt" "cancel"], :sigils ["÷/逆"], :title "Field Simplification for Reciprocal Goals", :tone "heuristic"}, :id "math-formalization/field-simp-reciprocal", :keywords ["field-simp" "reciprocal" "division" "ne_of_gt" "cancel"], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["÷/逆"], :source-path "library/math-formalization/field-simp-reciprocal.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "Field Simplification for Reciprocal Goals", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "  Classify or produce counterexamples for finite groups using Fintype.card and ZMod.card."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "Goal involves group order, cyclicity, or commutativity of specific finite groups."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "Abstract group theory lemmas may not compute; need concrete Fintype instances."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "Use Fintype.card_perm, ZMod.card, IsCyclic.isCommutative, decide tactic."} {:name "LEAN", :name-key "lean", :slug "lean", :text "      api[Fintype.card] api[ZMod.card] api[IsCyclic.isCommutative] api[Equiv.swap]\n      tactic[decide → exact → classical]"} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "Lean's decide tactic closes concrete finite-group goals by computation."}], :conclusion "  Classify or produce counterexamples for finite groups using Fintype.card and ZMod.card.", :directives {:audience "lean-provers, algebra-students", :keywords ["finite-group" "classification" "cyclic" "abelian" "order" "Fintype" "ZMod"], :sigils ["🏷️/群"], :title "Finite Group Classification and Counterexamples", :tone "heuristic"}, :id "math-formalization/finite-group-classification", :keywords ["finite-group