east two candidate reads."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    The agent acts after reading only the suggested pattern or none at all."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Candidate lists may be short or empty in some runs."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    If candidates exist, read the AIF suggestion plus one additional candidate before tools."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    Comparative reads reduce fixation and improve PSR rationale quality."} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - evidence: two pattern-action read events recorded for candidates in the same turn.\n    - evidence-shape: {:pattern/id :string, :action \"read\", :turn :int}"}], :conclusion "Read the AIF-suggested pattern plus one other candidate before acting.", :directives {:audience "fulab agents, musn server", :sigils ["🗿/三"], :style "pattern", :title "Read AIF Suggestion Plus One", :tone "technical"}, :id "musn/read-aif-plus-one", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["🗿/三"], :source-path "library/musn/read-aif-plus-one.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "Read AIF Suggestion Plus One", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "A pattern selection (PSR) must precede any implement/update action."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "Implement/update without a chosen pattern breaks auditability and PSR→PUR reasoning."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    An implement or update is attempted without a PSR in the current turn."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Some edits might be exploratory or off-trail and should be gated."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Reject or pause implement/update until `turn/select` is recorded; log PSR with candidates, reason, anchors."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    PSR anchors edits to intent, enabling PUR validation and evidence linking."} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - evidence: :pattern/selection-claimed + :pattern/selection summary; implement/update action accepted after PSR.\n    - evidence-shape: {:turn :int, :decision/id :string, :pattern/id :string, :candidates [:string], :selection/reason :map, :selection/anchors [:map]}"}], :conclusion "A pattern selection (PSR) must precede any implement/update action.", :directives {:audience "fulab agents, musn server", :sigils ["🎴/功"], :style "pattern", :title "Selection Before Implement/Update", :tone "technical"}, :id "musn/selection-before-write", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["🎴/功"], :source-path "library/musn/selection-before-write.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "Selection Before Implement/Update", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "Do not guess tool names; use known helpers and documented commands."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "Tool hallucinations cause avoidable failures and derail runs."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    The agent invents a tool name or command that does not exist."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    The agent still needs flexibility to select among helpers."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Only use documented helpers (pattern-action, pattern-select, pattern-use, musn-plan)."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    Tool hygiene reduces failures and keeps logs consistent."} {:name "NEXT-STEPS", :name-key "next-steps", :slug "next-steps", :text "    - evidence: no \"command not found\" for pattern helper tools during the run.\n 