 milestone and the evidence needed to validate it.]\n    next[Draft a narrative + financial proof template for early pilots.]\n    next[Add explicit thresholds for each milestone (e.g., % cost recovery, repeat participation rate).]"}], :conclusion "  Define PoC success as evidence that the system can move from cost → partial cost recovery → stable participation → self-sustaining adoption, documenting each step with narrative + financial proof.", :directives {:audience "funders, programme managers, NGO strategists", :sigils ["👫/女" "🚴/匀"], :style "design-pattern", :title "Sustainable Trajectory", :tone "analytic"}, :id "vsatlas/sustainable-trajectory", :keywords [], :projection-version "flexiarg-v0", :references [], :scores {}, :sigils ["👫/女" "🚴/匀"], :source-path "library/vsatlas/sustainable-trajectory.flexiarg", :sources [], :status :ok, :title "Sustainable Trajectory", :typed-slots nil} #:pattern{:clauses [{:name "conclusion", :name-key "conclusion", :slug "conclusion", :text "  Design the manifold so contributors progress from authors → collective members → FLOSS contributors → maintainers via explicit scaffolds."} {:name "context", :name-key "context", :slug "context", :text "You are designing participation pathways so contributors can grow into maintainers, ensuring the ecosystem renews itself over time. This does not apply when the community is intentionally short-lived."} {:name "IF", :name-key "if", :slug "if", :text "    Platforms with only a few maintainers stagnate and collapse when those maintainers depart."} {:name "HOWEVER", :name-key "however", :slug "however", :text "    Contributors remain single-use authors with no path toward deeper participation."} {:name "THEN", :name-key "then", :slug "then", :text "    Design the manifold so contributors progress from authors → collective members → FLOSS contributors → maintainers via explicit scaffolds."} {:name "BECAUSE", :name-key "because", :slug "because", :text "    An upful learning trajectory produces a 